snmp-server user admin network-admin auth md5 174C98911CA83F8964E99BB20220432CF548 priv aes-128 0162CFE315F83B9E5BA4BDF75D63043CA54E localizedV2key
rmon event 1 log trap public description FATAL(1) owner PMON@FATAL
rmon event 2 log trap public description CRITICAL(2) owner PMON@CRITICAL
